# aliprehook user registry: which hook runs before which command, per project.
#
# Columns (whitespace-separated):
#   project_key  command  hook_relative_path
#
# Get the key for the current directory with: aliprehook_project_key
# Hook paths are relative to ~/.config/aliprehook/ (or absolute).
# The first matching line wins.
#
# Example: run the safe example hook before `Dup` in one repo.
# github.com/org/sample_app_web  Dup  hooks/example_echo.sh
